Package: entra-sssd
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dhruv Setty <91457220+whatheheckisthis@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, sed
Recommends: sssd (>= 2.11.0), sssd-idp, libnss-sss, libpam-sss, sssd-tools
Homepage: https://github.com/whatheheckisthis/agent-q
Description: Entra ID sign in for Debian hosts with SSSD
 Configuration templates and scripts that let Debian hosts authenticate
 Microsoft Entra ID users through the SSSD idp provider, using the OAuth 2.0
 Device Authorization Grant and POSIX IDs derived from Entra object IDs.
 Includes an apt pin to take SSSD from Debian forky on bookworm and trixie,
 and an alternative OpenLDAP domain.
